{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t神舟二十四號計劃近日擇機發射，船箭組合體今日轉運至發射區。<br/>\n<br/>\n根據中國載人航天工程辦公室，神舟二十四號載人飛船與長征二號F遙二十四運載火箭組合體，已轉運至發射區。<br/>\n<br/>\n目前，發射場設施設備狀態良好，後續將按計劃開展發射前的各項功能檢查、聯合測試等工作，計劃近日擇機實施發射。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：羅宇光\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:13:42.587225+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T11:50:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T01:37:10.771631+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T12:07:00.729625+00:00","content_hash":"d4e49c709a6e5b4fab55677d64d3fdc5b1bd3b2ed3e35e9319cc3a9d0f35bfd2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}